'''LargadosyPelados''' (formerly stylized as '''largadosypelados''') is an organization-less [[:Category:Brazil|Brazilian]] ''[[Counter-Strike 2]]'' team and a former ''[[Counter-Strike: Global Offensive]]'' team that originally formed in October 2022. Its second iteration was formed after [[Nitro.GG]] released their team, while the third and current iteration was formed shortly after the second iteration disbanded.

==Timeline==
{{tabs dynamic
|name1=2022
|name2=2023
|name3=2025
|name4=2026
|This=4
|content1=
* October 7th - '''largadosypelados''' is formed with a roster consisting of [[realziN]], [[t9rnay]], [[ckzao]], [[n9xtz]]. <ref name="lyp">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/t9rnay/status/1578477740663398406|title=Buscando Organização|language={{flag|br}} Portuguese|trans_title=Seeking Organization|date=2022-10-07|author=[[t9rnay]]}}</ref>
* November 20th - [[detr0ittJ]] and [[betinho]] join '''largadosypelados'''. <ref name="detroit">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/detr0ittJ/status/1594404422234226688|title=Daotsu & Futuro|language={{flag|br}} Portuguese|trans_title=Daotsu & Future|date=2022-11-20|author=[[detr0ittJ]]}}</ref>
* November 27th - '''largadosypelados''' replace [[n9xtz]] with [[danoco]]. <ref name="danoco">{{cite web|url=https://www.dust2.com.br/noticias/32504/danoco-reforca-largadosypelados|title=danoco reforça largadosypelados|language={{flag|br}} Portuguese|trans_title=danoco reinforces largadosypelados|date=2022-11-27|author=[[gabrielpumba]]|publisher=[[Dust2.com.br]]}}</ref>

|content2=
* January 24th - '''largadosypelados''' are signed by [[RED Canids]]. <ref name="REDS 2023 ">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/REDCanids/status/1617994939010547712|title=Confira os lobos que vão representar a matilha no CS:GO!|trans_title=Check out the wolves that will represent the pack in CS:GO!|language={{Flag|br}} Portuguese|date=2023-01-24|author=[[RED Canids]]}}</ref>

|content3=
* June 21st - '''LargadosyPelados''' is reformed by the former [[Nitro.GG]] roster consisting of [[happ]], [[realz1n]], [[zmb]], [[Leomonster]], [[bsd]], and [[Disturbed_(Brazilian_player)|disturbed]], the latter as the team's coach. <ref name="lyp 2025">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/zmbLeo/status/1936494252613304791|title=Salve, galera!|language={{flag|br}} Portuguese|trans_title=Hey, guys!|date=2025-06-21|author=[[zmb]]}}</ref>
