* July 21st - [[realz1n]] steps down from the team and is replaced by [[proSHOW]]. <ref name="-realz1n">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/realz1nfps/status/1947418129338138971|title=Hoje anuncio oficialmente o fim da minha carreira como jogador|language={{flag|br}} Portuguese|trans_title=Today I officially announce the end of my career as a player|date=2025-07-21|author=[[realz1n]]}}</ref><ref name="+proshow">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/proshowfps/status/1947295718705614908|title=Ciclo encerrado + Novo projeto|language={{flag|br}} Portuguese|trans_title=Cycle Closed + New Project|date=2025-07-21|author=[[proSHOW]]}}</ref>
* July 24th - '''LargadosyPelados''' disbands. <ref name="-1st 2025">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/disturbedcs2/status/1948394242902003872|title=guys, queria avisar a todos que o projeto LP/NITRO chegou ao fim...|language={{flag|br}} Portuguese|trans_title=guys, I wanted to let everyone know that the LP/NITRO project has come to an end...|date=2025-07-24|author=[[Disturbed_(Brazilian_player)|disturbed]]}}</ref>
* August 30th - '''LargadosyPelados''' is reformed with a roster consisting of [[happ]], [[zmb]], [[Leomonster]], [[divine (Brazilian player)|divine]], [[Alisson]], and [[Disturbed_(Brazilian_player)|disturbed]], the latter as the team's coach. <ref name="lyp 2025 2">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/zmbLeo/status/1961806846949224819|title=Fala, galera!|language={{flag|br}} Portuguese|trans_title=Hey, guys!|date=2025-08-30|author=[[zmb]]}}</ref>

|content4=
* May 12th - '''LargadosyPelados''' add [[reg1no]] as an analyst. <ref name="+reg1no">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/LyPcs2/status/2054286327726715164|title=Ele já vem nos ajudando nos bastidores há um tempo, mas chegou a hora de dar as boas vindas oficial para o @reginofps, que chega para somar como nosso analista!|language={{flag|br}} Portuguese|trans_title=He’s been helping us behind the scenes for a while now, but the time has come to officially welcome @reginofps, who is joining the team as our analyst!|date=2026-05-12|author='''LargadosyPelados'''}}</ref>
* October 1st - [[Leomonster]] steps down from '''LargadosyPelados'''. <ref name="-leo">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/LyPcs2/status/2105734254608949382|title=Hoje nos despedimos do @Leomonsterfps|language={{flag|br}} Portuguese|trans_title=Today we say goodbye to @Leomonsterfps|date=2026-10-01|author='''LargadosyPelados'''}}</ref>
}}

