|content1=
*September 19th - '''Life's A Game''' enter ''[[Counter-Strike: Global Offensive]]'' with the signing of a roster consisting of [[garfield]], [[raw1]], [[graha]], [[taiwi]], and [[garret]]. <ref name="1st roster">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/LifesAGameGG/status/1571922076717441025|title=A new chapter begins|date=2022-09-19|author='''Life's A Game'''}}</ref>
*September 28th - '''Life's A Game''' part ways with their lineup. <ref name="-1st roster">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/LifesAGameGG/status/1575212664090857474|title=With our CSGO season concluded, we want to give a big thanks to the roster for putting on a show|date=2022-09-28|author='''Life's A Game'''}}</ref>
* October 26th - '''Life's A Game''' sign a new roster consisting of [[CAJUN]], [[mcniff]], [[caustic]], [[GRAVES]], and [[R00T]]. <ref name="2nd roster">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/LifesAGameGG/status/1585376583250235392|title=Jumping right back into the CSGO @ESEA Advanced Division!|date=2022-10-26|author='''Life's A Game'''}}</ref>
* November 11th - [[GRAVES]] leaves '''Life's A Game''' to join [[Take Flyte]]. <ref name="rb2">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/TakeFlyteGG/status/1591158014614142982|title=A slow Week 3 for us|date=2022-11-11|author=[[Take Flyte]]}}</ref>

|content2=
* January 10th - [[CAJUN]] leaves '''Life's A Game''' to join [[Louisville Red Wolves]]. <ref name="-cajun">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/Locke_CS/status/1612900341259042816|title=Happy to report I'm continuing with Red Wolves for Advanced Season 44...|date=2023-01-10|author=[[Locke]]}}</ref>
* January 18th - '''Life's A Game''' sign [[swifty-]]. <ref name="+swifty">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/LifesAGameGG/status/1615831762336350208|title=Time to Run It Back in @ESEA  Advanced! |date=2023-01-18|author='''Life's A Game'''}}</ref>
* February 16th - [[caustic]] leaves '''Life's A Game''' to join [[Louisville Red Wolves]]. <ref name="-caustic">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/HitByBus55/status/1626490938179608578|title=Joined @LouRedWolves for the foreseeable future |date=2023-02-16|author=[[caustic]]}}</ref>
* April 10th - '''Life's A Game''' sign a new roster consisting of [[Kismer]], [[YNGHunter]], [[Huntxr]], [[twigs]], and [[lect]]. <ref name="3rd roster">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/LifesAGameGG/status/1645590258518757376|title=Back at it in Advance for Season 45!|date=2023-04-10|author='''Life's A Game'''}}</ref>
* May 2nd - '''Life's A Game''' replace [[Kismer]] with [[CRADDOCK]]. <ref name="+craddock">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/twigscs/status/1653499825135013905|title=Very excited to welcome @CRADDOCKcs to LAG as our new fifth|date=2023-05-02|author=[[twigs]]}}</ref>
* May 13th - '''Life's A Game''' part ways with [[lect]]. <ref name="-lect">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/lectcs/status/1657436956266233857|title=benched from lag|date=2023-05-13|author=[[lect]]}}</ref>
* May 29th - '''Life's A Game''' part ways with [[CRADDOCK]]. <ref name="-craddock">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/CRADDOCKfps/status/1663310017745805313|title=LFT ADV S46|date=2023-05-29|author=[[CRADDOCK]]}}</ref>
* October 22nd - '''Life's A Game''' sign a new roster consisting of [[based]], [[Nyyx]], [[Experative]], [[X-23]], and [[ogwizard]]. <ref name="4th roster">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/LifesAGameGG/status/1716186812677505504|title=Welcome our CS2 Roster for @ESEA Season 47!!!|date=2023-10-22|author='''Life's A Game'''}}</ref>

|content3=
* January 23rd - '''Life's A Game''' part ways with [[X-23]] and sign [[nicx]]. <ref name="+nicx">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/laggaming_/status/1749907820143956308|title=CS ROSTER UPDATE|date=2024-01-23|author='''Life's A Game'''}}</ref>
* April 12th - '''Life's A Game''' sign [[ioRascal]] as the team's coach. <ref name="iorascal">{{cite web|url=https://www.dust2.us/news/47315/lag-unveil-new-coach|title=LAG unveil new coach|date=2024-04-12|publisher=[[Dust2.us]]|author=[[Mnmzzz]]}}</ref>
* June 14th - '''Life's A Game''' part ways with [[based]]. <ref name="-based">{{cite web|url=https://www.dust2.us/news/49716/lag-lose-one-as-based-decamps-to-serbia|title=LAG lose one as based decamps to Serbia|date=2024-06-14|publisher=[[Dust2.us]]|author=[[Mnmzzz]]}}</ref>
* July 15th - '''Life's A Game''' sign [[Weeza]] and [[Takumi]], the latter as an assistant coach. <ref name="+weeza">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/LagGaming_/status/1812921073509494984|title=Last season was just a test drive|date=2024-07-15|author='''Life's A Game'''}}</ref>
* August 13th - '''Life's A Game''' part ways with [[Nyyx]] and sign [[rayxts]] as his replacement. Additionally, [[ioRascal]] steps down from the team and is replaced by [[Takumi]] in an interim role. <ref name="-iosracal">{{cite web|url=https://www.dust2.us/news/51701/lag-hope-for-explosive-impact-from-roster-swap-coaching-changes|title=LAG hope for explosive impact from roster swap, coaching changes|date=2024-08-13|publisher=[[Dust2.us]]|author=[[theroadtodrwaldo]]}}</ref>
* August 24th - '''Life's A Game''' sign [[ElPrincipe]] as coach while [[Takumi]] returns to his assistant coach role. <ref name="+elprincipe">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/LagGaming_/status/1827360216222200235|title=Time to put our boys to work @elprincipecsgo|date=2024-08-24|author='''Life's A Game'''}}</ref>
* September 17th - [[ogwizard]] leaves '''Life's A Game''' to [[Party Astronauts]] and is replaced by [[TR0JN]], who joins on trial. <ref name="+trojin">{{cite web|url=https://www.dust2.us/news/53075/lag-add-tr0jn-on-trial|title=LAG add TR0JN on trial|date=2024-09-17|publisher=[[Dust2.us]]|author=[[Mnmzzz]]}}</ref>
* November 11th - [[nicx]] and [[rayxts]] leave '''Life's A Game''' to join [[timbermen]]. <ref name="timbermen nicx">{{cite web|url=https://www.dust2.us/news/55064/timbermen-begin-overhaul-with-lag-duo|title=timbermen begin overhaul with LAG duo|date=2024-11-11|publisher=[[Dust2.us]]|author=[[Mnmzzz]]}}</ref>
* December 14th - [[Experative]] transitions into a managerial role within '''LAG Gaming'''. <ref name="exp manager">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/Experative/status/1868147739172958396|title=with the season ends, I will be stop competing as player|date=2024-12-14|author=[[Experative]]}}</ref>

|content4=
* January 13th - [[ElPrincipe]] leaves '''Life's A Game''' to join [[Sangal ALTERS]]. <ref name="alters">{{cite web|url=https://sangal.gg/sangals-cs2-academy-is-ready-1xalters/|title=Sangal’s CS2 Academy is Ready: 1XALTERS|date=2025-01-13|publisher=[[Sangal Esports]]}}</ref>
* January 18th - '''Life's A Game''' part ways with [[TR0JN]], sign [[rayxts]], [[SnacKZ1]], and [[spud]], and move [[Experative]] back into the starting lineup. <ref name="2025 roster">{{cite web|url=https://www.dust2.us/news/57150/lag-finish-assembling-new-roster-for-ecl-s49|title=LAG finish assembling new roster for ECL S49|date=2025-01-19|publisher=[[Dust2.us]]|author=[[Mnmzzz]]}}</ref>
* January 29th - '''Life's A Game''' part ways with [[rayxts]] and re-sign [[TR0JN]]. <ref name="tro returns">{{cite web|url=https://www.dust2.us/news/57506/tr0jn-returns-to-lag-amidst-role-shuffle|title=TR0JN returns to LAG amidst role shuffle|date=2025-01-29|publisher=[[Dust2.us]]|author=[[Mnmzzz]]}}</ref>
* March 26th - '''Life's A Game''''s roster disbands. <ref name="4th roster disband">{{cite web|url=https://www.dust2.us/news/59493/lag-disband-after-poor-start-to-2025|title=LAG disband after poor start to 2025|date=2025-03-26|publisher=[[Dust2.us]]|author=[[Mnmzzz]]}}</ref>
* June 6th - '''Life's A Game''' sign [[Vagrants]], a roster consisting of: [[Sandman]], [[mason]], [[brett]], [[consti]], [[Wolffe]], and [[Aureo]], the latter as the team's coach. <ref name="5th roster">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/LifesAGameGG/status/1931069228100055300|title=Resurged|date=2025-06-06|author='''Life's A Game'''}}</ref>
*August 17th - '''Life's A Game''' part ways with [[brett]]. <ref name="-brett">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/LifesAGameGG/status/1957118916456575426|title=Today, we say goodbye to not just a leader, but a true competitor|date=2025-08-17|author='''Life's A Game'''}}</ref>
*August 19th - '''Life's A Game''' sign [[djay]]. <ref name="+djay">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/LifesAGameGG/status/1957887703787200799|title=We are pleased to welcome our newest member to the CS2 team, @djaycs!|date=2025-08-19|author='''Life's A Game'''}}</ref>
*October 10th - '''Life's A Game''' part ways with [[Wolffe]] as he retires from competitive ''Counter-Strike''. <ref name="-wolffe">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/LifesAGameGG/status/1976653741542781028|title=Today we say goodbye to @WolffeTwitch as he retires from Counter-Strike|date=2025-10-10|author='''Life's A Game'''}}</ref>
* October 26th - '''Life's A Game''' sign [[kmrn]]. <ref name="+kmrn">{{cite web|url=https://www.dust2.us/news/67032/lag-returns-to-full-strength-with-kmrn|title=LAG returns to full strength with kmrn|date=2025-10-26|author=[[Mnmzzz]]|publisher=[[Dust2.us]]}}</ref>
*October 29th - '''Life's A Game''' part ways with [[mason]] as he retires from competitive ''Counter-Strike''. <ref name="-mason">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/masoncs2_/status/1983730289999585311|title=Stepping down from @LifesAGameGG and finished playing|date=2025-10-29|author=[[mason]]}}</ref>

|content5=
*January 12th - '''Life's A Game''' re-sign [[Wolffe]]. <ref name="+wolffe">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/LifesAGameGG/status/2010804500609806425|title=LAG 2026 ROSTER|date=2026-01-12|author='''Life's A Game'''}}</ref>
*March 5th - '''Life's A Game''' part ways with [[Wolffe]]. <ref name="-wolffe 2026">{{cite web|url=https://www.dust2.us/news/71330/lag-part-ways-with-wolffe-ahead-of-new-signing-alleged-scheduling-issues|title=LAG part ways with Wolffe ahead of new signing, alleged scheduling issues|date=2026-03-05|publisher=[[Dust2.us]]|author=[[Mnmzzz]]}}</ref>
*March 13th - '''Life's A Game''' acquire [[Cryptic]] from [[SkinRave Esports]]. <ref name="+cryptic">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/LifesAGameGG/status/2032532928534646835|title=We’re proud to welcome @CrypticTW to our roster lineup|date=2026-03-13|author='''Life's A Game'''}}</ref>
*May 14th - [[consti]] is acquired by [[SportsBetExpert]]. <ref name="-consti">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/lifesagamegg/status/2055017523528212890|title=LAG has mutually agreed to the immediate release and transfer of Kevin “Consti” Yi to Sports Bet Expert|date=2026-05-14|author='''Life's A Game'''}}</ref>
*May 17th - '''Life's A Game''' part ways with [[Aureo]]. <ref name="-Aureo">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/LifesAGameGG/status/2056028238099468447|title=LAG has mutually agreed to part ways with Brennan “Aureo” O’Connell and release him from his contract|date=2026-05-17|author='''Life's A Game'''}}</ref>
*June 11th - '''Life's A Game''' part ways with [[kmrn]]. <ref name="-kmrn">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/LifesAGameGG/status/2065162970112446766|title=LAG and Kmrn have mutually agreed to part ways|date=2026-06-11|author='''Life's A Game'''}}</ref>
* June 26th - '''Life's A Game''' sign [[Bwills]] and [[SLIGHT]]. <ref name="new duo">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/LifesAGameGG/status/2070574939204452851|title=Brought in a couple of bosses|date=2026-06-26|author='''Life's A Game'''}}</ref>
