'''Lilmix''' is a [[:Category:Sweden|Swedish]] esports organization. '''Lilmix''' was started as a mixteam when the players [[quix]], [[hns]], [[WolfY]], [[elo]] and [[b0denmaster]] attended different LANs and tournaments. During 2019 they created a second team called '''Lilmix.Ourplays''' consisting of [[WolfY]], [[elo]], [[Per0N]], [[KriLLe]], and [[Slajden]].

