* January - [[WolfY]] and [[elo]] leave '''Lilmix''' to join [[Lilmix.Ourplays]]. <ref name="Lilmix.Ourplays">{{inside source}}</ref>
* April 8th - [[WolfY]] joins '''Lilmix''' and [[b0denmaster]] replace him in '''Lilmix.Ourplays'''. <ref name="Lilmix.Ourplays 2.0">{{inside source}}</ref>
* July 29th - '''Lilmix''' part ways with their manager [[Nebroy]]. <ref name="Nebroy leave">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Lilmixgg/status/1155771096873996288|title=Today we are saying farewell to our lovely manager @AmarSijamic who is now parting ways with @Lilmixgg|publisher='''Lilmix'''|date=2019-07-29}}</ref>
*August 24th - '''Lilmix.Ourplays''' disbands. [[b0denmaster]] stays in the organization as manager. <ref name="Lilmix.Ourplay disband">{{cite web|url=https://www.twitlonger.com/show/n_1sr05hs|title=Today we can officially confirm that Lilmix.Ourplays will be no more|publisher='''Lilmix'''|date=2019-08-24}}</ref>
* September 1st - [[The Final Tribe]] release their squad, the remaining players except [[vanity (British_player)|vanity]] join '''Lilmix''' until they find a new organization. <ref name="TFT release CS:GO team">{{cite web|url=https://www.facebook.com/TheFinalTribe/videos/489662881852875|title=|publisher=[[The Final Tribe]]|date=2019-08-29}}</ref><ref name="TFT join Lilmix">{{inside source}}</ref>
* December 20th - [[hns]] announces that the roster of '''Lilmix''' will not continue to play together. <ref name="Lilix split up">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/csgohns/status/1208088751731290114|author=[[hns]]|date=2019-12-20|title=After more than a year with the best people in the world we decided to part ways as a team and im now a free agent and looking for a team for 2020}}</ref>

|content2=
* February 2nd - [[quix]], [[b0denmaster]], [[pyth]], [[kreaz]] and [[Peppzor]] join '''Lilmix''' until they find a new organization. <ref name="Lilmix 2.0">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/quixcsgo/status/1224070511946276867|author=[[quix]]|date=2020-02-02|title=As of today me, kreaz, b0denn, pythCS and PeppzorCSGO are all free agents and will be looking for an organisation to represent. We will play under ”Lilmix” during the time until we find ourselves a home.}}</ref> 
* February 5th - [[kreaz]] leaves '''Lilmix''' to join [[Syman Gaming]]. <ref name="kreaz leaves">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/symangg/status/1224968659602497536|title=Today we are pleased to announce two new players of Syman Gaming!|date=2020-02-05|author=[[Syman Gaming]]}}</ref>
* February 17th - [[Peppzor]] leaves '''Lilmix'''. <ref name="Peppzor leaves Lilmix">{{inside source}}</ref>
* February 18th - [[pyth]] leaves '''Lilmix'''. <ref name="Pyth leaves Lilmix">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/pythCS/status/1229733880518922240|date=2020-02-18|title=I'm looking for a new opportunity in a new team and I'm open to discuss all offers from any region|author=[[pyth]]}}</ref>
* April 20th - [[hns]], [[Downie]] and [[Svedjehed]] join '''Lilmix'''. <ref name="hns Downie Svedjehed join">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Lilmixgg/status/1252289008677330945|author='''Lilmix'''|date=2020-04-20|title=We would like to announce a new CSGO team}}</ref> 
