* August 9th - [[Svedjehed]] leaves '''Lilmix'''. <ref name="Svedjehed leaves">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Lilmixgg/status/1292525289516523524|author='''Lilmix'''|date=2020-08-09|title=Good things always come to an end.}}</ref>
